# Case: Idle desktop wakes for asynchronous service changes
# Mode: native
# Purpose: Verify native service event and content completion delivery.
# Steps:
#   Start an isolated desktop, await one history item and idle UI, submit another item, then await its display and idle UI.
# Expected:
#   Current native work settles and service changes appear without input or manual refresh; event-wakeup checks future heartbeat timers.
# Forbidden:
#   Unsettled current frames, lost completions, fixture history, system clipboard writes or missing native evidence.

start
submit initial 'Memory acceptance initial text'
ui-wait listItem 'Memory acceptance initial text'
ui-idle
screenshot idle
submit changed 'Memory acceptance asynchronous change'
ui-wait listItem 'Memory acceptance asynchronous change'
ui-idle
screenshot changed
